# Resolves a place target on the table to a pose in the planning frame, and whether the arm
# reaches it with the held object, before PlaceObject commits to it.
# As in PlaceObject: "free" (also when empty), "relative", "metric" or "anchor", with x and y.
string mode
float64 x
float64 y
# Anchor mode: where the anchor is (e.g. an earlier place_pose); an empty frame_id: the best match.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped anchor_pose
---
bool success
string message
# The target's centre on the table; valid only when success is true and mode is not "free".
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target
# Whether a top-down placement at the target is within the arm's reach.
bool reachable
